Statement of changes (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Modifications by SerpentX (2025-2026), also licensed under GNU GPL v3.0, extend
the pool layer from two pools to up to four, with a configurable per-pool
weighted hashrate split and live web-UI tuning. The complete, dated list of
changes is the git commit history of this repository.

